# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas responsive

Optimize layouts across desktop (1440px), tablet (768px), and mobile (375px) viewports.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-responsive [request]` or `/pure-saas responsive [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Inspect layout across 1440px desktop, 768px tablet, and 375px mobile viewports.
2. Eliminate horizontal scroll issues, wrap overflowing identifiers, and use container scroll wrappers on dense tables.
3. Ensure touch targets on interactive controls meet the 44x44px minimum bounding box.
4. Scale large display headings gracefully on mobile to prevent single-word line breaks.
5. Retain all backend API connections, event listeners, and form validations.
